## Project Details

**Project Title:**
ApplyMate AI — AI-Powered Job Application Assistant

**Project Description:**
ApplyMate AI is an open-source, end-to-end AI job application assistant. Users upload their resume (PDF) and paste a job description to instantly get: ATS compatibility score, AI-powered keyword gap analysis with priority ranking, tailored cover letter, personalized skill gap roadmap with free learning resources, and role-specific interview questions with model answers. All features are completely free, no account needed, no API key required — powered by Groq AI (Llama 3.3 70B) on the backend.

**Tech Stack Used:**
Python, Streamlit, Groq AI (Llama 3.3 70B), Google Gemini 2.0 Flash, PyPDF2, pdfplumber, pandas, scikit-learn, NLTK

