**What problem does it solve:**
Every existing job application tool stops halfway — Jobscan gives ATS score but no cover letter, no interview prep, no skill roadmap. ApplyMate AI completes the entire application pipeline in one free, open-source tool with no API key needed by users(Sometimes needed when Quota limit exceeds).
